title: "pallet-vesting: prevent self vested transfers to avoid storage pollution"
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Disallow `vested_transfer` and `force_vested_transfer` when `source == target`.

    When the source and target of a vested transfer are the same account, `Currency::transfer`
    is a no-op (returns `Ok(())` without moving funds), but the vesting lock is still written
    to storage.

    This patch adds a `SelfVestedTransfer` error and rejects the operation early in
    `do_vested_transfer` before any storage writes or currency operations occur.

    A new honggfuzz-based fuzzer (`pallet-vesting-fuzzer`) is also introduced, exercising random
    sequences of vesting operations and checking storage invariants after every action.
crates:
- name: pallet-vesting
  bump: major
- name: pallet-vesting-fuzzer
  bump: minor
